---
// ApertureTrim: the four separate stepped black corner shapes that frame a
// meter's window (Design 01 section 6). Never a uniform border: an upper cap
// with a downward return, a lower cap with an upward return, a side segment
// and a small tab. Purely decorative, so aria-hidden.
---

<span class="aperture-trim" aria-hidden="true">
	<span class="aperture-trim__cap aperture-trim__cap--top"></span>
	<span class="aperture-trim__cap aperture-trim__cap--bottom"></span>
	<span class="aperture-trim__side"></span>
	<span class="aperture-trim__tab"></span>
</span>
